OL,3,GNEWSABomb evacuation community spirit
OL,4,Apraised
OL,5,
OL,6,FA town's community spirit has been
OL,7,Fpraised following an operation to
OL,8,Fremove a World War Two bomb from a
OL,9,Fdock.
OL,11,FEmergency services took the suspected
OL,12,F250lb (115kg) American "air-dropped"
OL,13,Fdevice from Falmouth Docks in Cornwall
OL,14,Fout to sea, where navy bomb experts
OL,15,Fwill keep it for six days before
OL,16,Freturning to dispose it.
OL,18,FThe operation led to a 755m (2,477ft)
OL,19,Fcordon being set up in the area with
OL,20,Fmore than 300 homes evacuated and a
OL,21,Fhelp centre for displaced residents set
OL,22,Fup in All Saints' Church.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
