OL,3,GNEWSABomb evacuation community spirit
OL,4,Apraised
OL,5,
OL,6,FThalia Marrington, Cornwall Council's
OL,7,Fportfolio holder for public safety,
OL,8,Fsaid everyone playing a part and
OL,9,Ffollowing the guidance issued helped
OL,10,Fthe operation run smoothly.
